                                "sense_id": "4431e2ab-44fc-3043-920b-af7f39d8e4bd",
                                "text": "When Patience discovers the plot to porcelainize the flesh of America's fee-males (obsessed, of course, with beauty only under the savage dominion of — ptui! —male lookism), they kill her!"
